{
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.Backbreaker.HePushesYou": " He pushes you off from his knee, laughing as you flop to the ground, completely overwhelmed by the attack."
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.Backbreaker.TheMassiveBeast": "The massive beast grabs and lifts your entire body up to his eye level. Before you can free yourself from his grasp, he places a knee under your body and throws you down towards it.\nHis knee crashes against your back with vicious force, and you can do nothing but groan and go limp from the searing pain."
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.Backbreaker.YourFeelNumb": "\nYour [legs] feel numb; the attack has hit deep and temporarily impaired your ability to attack. You're [b: crippled]!"
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.Backbroken.Recovered": "[pg-]The worst of the pain has passed, you're no longer [b:crippled]![pg-]"
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.Backbroken.StillCrippled": "[pg-]You're still [b:crippled], and cannot use physical abilities.[pg-]"
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.ChargeGrab.HeSaysPanting": "[say: By Marae, you're fucking heavy!] He says, panting."
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.ChargeGrab.TheMassiveBeast": "The massive beast attempts to lift your body, but your heft proves too large for him! He struggles for a moment, attempting to gather enough strength to properly attack you, but you soon recover your wits and break free of his grasp."
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.ChargeGrab.TheRhinoMorph": "The rhino morph reaches you and immediately charges you down, the sheer inertia of his massive body breaking through any defenses you might put up. He smiles sadistically at you as you attempt to get up, grabbing you before you have a chance to get back in the fight!"
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.ChargeStart.HeCurlsHis": "[pg]He curls his body and readies himself before charging towards you with frightening speed!"
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.ChargeStart.TheRhinoMorph": "The rhino morph cracks his knuckles and stares intensely at you. [say: C'mere, cupcake.]"
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.DropKick.Blocked": "You hide yourself behind your shield right before the mountain of muscle crashes against it, making you stumble and nearly breaking your arm, but keeping the rest of your body mostly intact. You shouldn't make a habit of this if you want to keep that limb!"
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.DropKick.Dodged": "You jump into a dodge roll and avoid the attack entirely. The rhino falls to the floor, the sheer weight of his body causing the ring to shake and making your recovery less than graceful. Regardless, you're intact."
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.DropKick.TakesADeep": "[Themonster] takes a deep breath and focuses his eyes on you. He begins running towards you, and after three ground shaking stomps he leaps, twisting his body into a powerful dropkick![pg]"
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.DropKick.TheMountainOf": "The mountain of muscle crashes against you, audibly knocking the air from your lungs while brutally crushing your torso. You're tossed backwards from the sheer force of attack, groaning loudly as you try to recover and get up again."
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.DropKick.TooHeavyAnd": "[pg]Too heavy and large for his short limbs, the rhino seems to struggle to get up again. You've got yourself a brief moment of respite!"
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.Headbutt.HeReleasesYou": "He releases you, laughing as you flop to the ground, completely overwhelmed by the attack."
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.Headbutt.TheMassiveBeast": "The massive beast grabs your head with both hands. You make a futile effort to break free, but you're unsuccessful. The rhino rears his head back before launching it forwards, crashing his horn against your forehead with grievous strength and speed. You see stars at first, and then every sense in your body is replaced with pain."
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.Headbutt.ToHisSurprise": " To his surprise, you quickly get back on your feet. His laughter switches in tone from mockery to respect as you stand up, even if you wobble as you do so. [say: Not bad, not bad at all.]"
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.Headbutt.YouTryTo": " You try to get up, but you're lucky to be conscious after that last attack; you're [b: stunned!]"
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.Piledriver.TheMassiveBeast": "The massive beast grabs and lifts your entire body up to his eye level, hanging you upside down for a few moments. He chuckles briefly before jumping and throwing you down towards the ground in a powerful piledrive move!"
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.Piledriver.UnfortunatelyYouCannot": "\nUnfortunately, you cannot."
  "Combat.RhinoBouncer.Piledriver.YourHeadCrashes": " Your head crashes violently against the ground, your entire body weight placed against it and aided by the force of his push. He releases your body and quickly gets up, unwilling to finish you off while you're on the ground. [say: Come on! You can do better than that, can't you, thief?]"
}
